half pow and fmod over +-0, +-inf, NaN and dyadic operands: NaN where C gives NaN, otherwise the signed zero or infinity C gives, or within the stated ulps of it -- CUDA's f32 pow within __powf's 2 + 2 |y log2 |x|| -- and fmod exactly (every backend): true
half fmod of constant operands, folded on the host: exactly C's fmod, the remainder taking the sign of the dividend under a negative modulus too (every backend): true
